          "say": "Two decimal places in the question, so the answer is 3.12.",
          "write": "2.4 × 1.3 = 3.12"
        },
        {
          "say": "5 sixths is 0.8333. Only the 3 repeats, so only it gets a dot.",
          "write": "5/6 = 0.83̇"
        }
